# This file ensures the output directory is tracked by Git
# 
# The output/ directory will contain generated vanity address results:
# - Bitcoin addresses with private keys (WIF format)
# - Ethereum addresses with private keys (hex format)  
# - Tor .onion addresses with private keys (PEM format)
#
# Files are automatically created with naming convention:
# {cryptocurrency}_vanity_{pattern}_{timestamp}.txt
#
# ⚠️  SECURITY WARNING:
# Generated files contain REAL private keys with access to funds.
# Keep this directory secure and never share private keys!
